{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimalist Instagram gallery section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the supplied reference screenshot as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT INSTRUCTION: Do not redesign or reinterpret the reference. Maintain the exact layout, image proportions, spacing, typography, colours, alignment, and visual hierarchy.
    
    1. OVERALL SECTION DESIGN
    
    Full-width Shopify section.
    
    Background colour: pure white (#FFFFFF).
    
    Maximum content width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop horizontal padding: 55px.
    
    Desktop vertical padding: 65px.
    
    Minimal, clean, premium editorial aesthetic.
    
    Use Montserrat typography throughout.
    
    No gradients, heavy shadows, or decorative backgrounds.
    
    2. HEADER – LEFT ALIGNMENT
    
    Create a header at the top-left.
    
    Eyebrow text:
    
    "— #KISSANDKRY"
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Size: 9px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: muted olive (#777D5D).
    
    Position above the main heading.
    
    Main heading:
    
    "Tiny Moments, Shared."
    
    Font: Montserrat Bold.
    
    Size: 36px desktop.
    
    Colour: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    Line height: 1.2.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    Margin-top: 8px.
    
    3. INSTAGRAM FOLLOW BUTTON
    
    Position the Instagram follow button at the top-right of the section.
    
    Button content:
    Instagram outline icon + "Follow @kissandkry"
    
    Design:
    
    White background.
    
    Thin olive-grey border (#C9CDBD).
    
    Pill-shaped border radius: 30px.
    
    Height: 42px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 20px.
    
    Font: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Text colour: #626B4C.
    
    Instagram icon: small, 13px.
    
    Vertically centred content.
    
    Subtle hover transition.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Make the entire button clickable.
    
    Link to the Instagram profile: https://www.instagram.com/kissandkry/
    
    Open in a new tab.
    
    4. INSTAGRAM IMAGE GALLERY
    
    This is the most important component.
    
    Create a single horizontal row containing EXACTLY SIX equally sized image tiles on desktop.
    
    Layout specifications:
    
    Six columns.
    
    Equal image dimensions.
    
    Image aspect ratio: approximately 1:1.
    
    Desktop image dimensions: approximately 160px × 160px.
    
    Horizontal gap: 10px.
    
    Border radius: 12px.
    
    Object-fit: cover.
    
    Object-position: center.
    
    No borders.
    
    No heavy shadows.
    
    All images must have identical dimensions.
    
    The gallery must span almost the entire available content width., IMAGE 1 – BABY CLOSE-UP
    
    Close-up lifestyle photograph of a smiling baby.
    
    Baby wearing a mustard-yellow bamboo outfit.
    
    Face clearly visible.
    
    Natural warm lighting.
    
    Soft premium photography.
    
    IMAGE 2 – BABY IN WHITE
    
    Baby wearing a white bamboo babywear outfit.
    
    Baby sitting comfortably against a soft knitted cream blanket.
    
    Warm natural lighting.
    
    Premium editorial photography.
    
    IMAGE 3 – INSTAGRAM FEATURE TILE
    
    Create a special Instagram promotional tile instead of a baby photograph.
    
    Background: muted olive green (#626B4C).
    
    Add subtle, low-opacity bamboo leaf illustrations.
    
    Place a white Instagram outline icon in the centre.
    
    Below the icon, display:
    "View on Instagram"
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Text colour: white.
    
    Keep the design minimal and centred.
    
    Make the entire tile clickable and link to the Instagram profile.
    
    IMAGE 4 – BABY IN SOFT WHITE
    
    Lifestyle photograph of a baby wearing a soft white bamboo outfit.
    
    Baby lying comfortably on a cream-coloured blanket.
    
    Natural daylight.
    
    Gentle, premium appearance.
    
    IMAGE 5 – BABY ON TEXTURED BLANKET
    
    Baby wearing a pale yellow bamboo outfit.
    
    Baby lying on a fluffy mustard-yellow / cream textured blanket.
    
    Top-down lifestyle photography.
    
    Warm and soft colour grading.
    
    IMAGE 6 – BABY IN WHITE OUTFIT
    
    Happy baby wearing a white bamboo outfit.
    
    Baby sitting or lying on a soft neutral blanket.
    
    Face clearly visible.
    
    Soft natural lighting.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    All six tiles must have consistent image dimensions and corner radii. Do not make one image larger than another., 5. IMAGE HOVER EFFECTS
    
    Apply subtle hover effects:
    
    Slight image zoom: scale(1.04).
    
    Smooth transition: 0.3 seconds.
    
    Keep images clipped within their rounded corners.
    
    No dramatic animations.
    
    Instagram promotional tile should also have a subtle hover effect.
    
    Each image should be individually clickable and support an optional Instagram post URL.
    
    6. COLOUR PALETTE
    
    Use the following brand colours:
    
    Section background: #FFFFFF
    
    Primary olive: #626B4C
    
    Secondary olive: #777D5D
    
    Button border: #C9CDBD
    
    Instagram tile background: #626B4C
    
    Instagram tile text: #FFFFFF
    
    Maintain a clean white-and-olive brand aesthetic.
    
    7. TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Use Montserrat exclusively.
    
    Eyebrow: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Main heading: Montserrat Bold.
    
    Button text: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Instagram tile text: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Maintain premium editorial typography with balanced spacing.
    
    8. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop
    
    Six images in one horizontal row.
    
    Heading on the left.
    
    Follow button on the right.
    
    Images span the available content width.
    
    Tablet
    
    Display four or five images depending on available width.
    
    Keep all image tiles equal in size.
    
    Allow horizontal scrolling if necessary.
    
    Mobile
    
    Heading at the top-left.
    
    Follow button positioned beneath or alongside the heading depending on available width.
    
    Gallery must support horizontal swipe scrolling.
    
    Display approximately 2.5 image tiles within the viewport to indicate more images are available.
    
    Image aspect ratio remains 1:1.
    
    Image width approximately 125px.
    
    Gap: 10px.
    
    Border radius: 10px.
    
    Hide horizontal scrollbar while retaining swipe functionality.
    
    Use 20px horizontal padding.
    
    Prevent horizontal page overflow., 9. SHOPIFY THEME EDITOR FUNCTIONALITY
    
    Generate a complete, self-contained Shopify Liquid section.
    
    Include editable settings for:
    
    Section settings:
    
    Eyebrow text.
    
    Main heading.
    
    Instagram username.
    
    Instagram profile URL.
    
    Follow button label.
    
    Section background colour.
    
    Heading colour.
    
    Accent colour.
    
    Section padding.
    
    Image dimensions.
    
    Image border radius.
    
    Image spacing.
    
    Mobile gallery settings.
    
    Gallery blocks:
    
    Image picker.
    
    Image alt text.
    
    Optional individual Instagram post URL.
    
    Enable/disable image.
    
    Image positioning / focal point.
    
    Allow the merchant to add, remove, edit, and reorder gallery images directly through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    Use Shopify image_picker settings.
    
    Make the Instagram promotional tile configurable.
    
    Use inline SVG for the Instagram icon.
    
    Use semantic HTML, lightweight CSS, and minimal JavaScript.
    
    Ensure full compatibility with Shopify Online Store 2.0.
    
    Do not modify existing theme sections., make all the text in this section as rich text 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;margin:auto;padding:{{ block.settings.padding }}px 55px;background:{{ block.settings.background }};box-sizing:border-box;font-family:{{ settings.type_body_font.family }},sans-serif}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{max-width:1200px;margin:auto}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:18px;margin-bottom:25px;color:{{ block.settings.accent }}}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head p{margin:0}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{font-size:36px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:700;color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};margin-top:8px!important}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__follow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:42px;padding:0 20px;border:1px solid #c9cdbd;border-radius:30px;background:#fff;color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__follow svg{width:14px;height:14px}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr));gap:{{ block.settings.gap }}px}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile{aspect-ratio:1;overflow:hidden;border-radius:{{ block.settings.radius }}px}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile img{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .3s ease}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile a{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile a:hover img{transform:scale(1.04)}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile svg{width:100%;height:100%}@media(max-width:749px){.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:40px 20px;overflow:hidden}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head{flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{font-size:28px}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__follow{margin-left:auto}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{display:flex;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;gap:{{ block.settings.mobile_gap }}px}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}.ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile{flex:0 0 {{ block.settings.mobile_width }}px;scroll-snap-align:start}}{% endstyle %}
<section class="ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner"><header class="ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head"><div><div class="ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow }}</div><div class="ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading }}</div></div>{% if block.settings.profile != blank %}<a class="ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__follow" href="{{ block.settings.profile }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r=".8" fill="currentColor"/></svg><span>{{ block.settings.follow_label }}</span> {{ block.settings.username }}</a>{% endif %}</header><div class="ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid">{% for i in (1..6) %}{% assign ik = 'image_' | append: i %}{% assign ak = 'alt_' | append: i %}{% assign uk = 'post_' | append: i %}{% assign image = block.settings[ik] %}{% if image %}<div class="ai-rich-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tile">{% if i == 3 and block.settings.promo_enabled %}<a href="{{ block.settings.profile }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="background:{{ block.settings.promo_background }};color:#fff;text-decoration:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;height:100%;font-size:11px"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r=".8" fill="currentColor"/></svg><span>{{ block.settings.promo_text }}</span></a>{% else %}{% if block.settings[uk] %}<a href="{{ block.settings[uk] }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{% endif %}<img src="{{ image | image_url: width: 700 }}" alt="{{ block.settings[ak] | strip_html | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ image.width }}" height="{{ image.height }}">{% if block.settings[uk] %}</a>{% endif %}{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
{% schema %}{"name":"Rich text gallery","settings":[{"type":"richtext","id":"eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"<p>— #KISSANDKRY</p>"},{"type":"richtext","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"<p>Tiny Moments, Shared.</p>"},{"type":"richtext","id":"username","label":"Instagram username","default":"<p>@kissandkry</p>"},{"type":"url","id":"profile","label":"Instagram profile URL"},{"type":"richtext","id":"follow_label","label":"Follow button label","default":"<p>Follow</p>"},{"type":"color","id":"background","label":"Section background","default":"#FFFFFF"},{"type":"color","id":"heading_color","label":"Heading color","default":"#626B4C"},{"type":"color","id":"accent","label":"Accent color","default":"#777D5D"},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"range","id":"padding","label":"Vertical padding","min":20,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":65},{"type":"range","id":"radius","label":"Image border radius","min":0,"max":24,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":12},{"type":"range","id":"gap","label":"Image spacing","min":5,"max":30,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":10},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_width","label":"Mobile tile width","min":100,"max":180,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":125},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_gap","label":"Mobile spacing","min":5,"max":20,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":10},{"type":"checkbox","id":"promo_enabled","label":"Promo tile at position 3","default":true},{"type":"richtext","id":"promo_text","label":"Promo tile text","default":"<p>View on Instagram</p>"},{"type":"color","id":"promo_background","label":"Promo tile background","default":"#626B4C"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_1","label":"Image 1"},{"type":"richtext","id":"alt_1","label":"Alt text 1","default":"<p>Babywear photo one</p>"},{"type":"url","id":"post_1","label":"Post URL 1"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_2","label":"Image 2"},{"type":"richtext","id":"alt_2","label":"Alt text 2","default":"<p>Babywear photo two</p>"},{"type":"url","id":"post_2","label":"Post URL 2"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_3","label":"Image 3"},{"type":"richtext","id":"alt_3","label":"Alt text 3","default":"<p>Babywear photo three</p>"},{"type":"url","id":"post_3","label":"Post URL 3"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_4","label":"Image 4"},{"type":"richtext","id":"alt_4","label":"Alt text 4","default":"<p>Babywear photo four</p>"},{"type":"url","id":"post_4","label":"Post URL 4"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_5","label":"Image 5"},{"type":"richtext","id":"alt_5","label":"Alt text 5","default":"<p>Babywear photo five</p>"},{"type":"url","id":"post_5","label":"Post URL 5"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_6","label":"Image 6"},{"type":"richtext","id":"alt_6","label":"Alt text 6","default":"<p>Babywear photo six</p>"},{"type":"url","id":"post_6","label":"Post URL 6"}],"presets":[{"name":"Rich text gallery"}],"tag":null,"class":"rich-text-gallery"}{% endschema %}